// The certificate below was emitted by OpenSSL (`openssl req -x509 -newkey
// ed25519`), not written by hand. That is deliberate: a DER decoder checked
// only against bytes this module invented would encode its own
// misunderstandings into the test and reject every real certificate while
// passing.

